{'symbol': 'TTWO', 'date': '2019-11-18 22:30:00', 'title': 'PROLETARIAT, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RECEIVED $20 MILLION IN FUNDING FROM TAKE-TWO INTERACTIVE SOFTWARE, INC., SPARK CAPITAL PARTNERS, LLC, FIRSTMARK CAPITAL, L.L.C., AND OTHER INVESTORS', 'text': 'ON NOVEMBER 19, 2019, PROLETARIAT, INC. CLOSED THE TRANSACTION. THE COMPANY RAISED $20,000,000 IN ITS SERIES C ROUND OF FUNDING LED BY NEW INVESTOR TAKE-TWO INTERACTIVE SOFTWARE, INC. (NASDAQGS:TTWO). THE TRANSACTION ALSO INVOLVED PARTICIPATION FROM RETURNING INVESTORS, SPARK CAPITAL PARTNERS, LLC, FIRSTMARK CAPITAL, L.L.C. AND OTHER INVESTORS. AS PART OF THE TRANSACTION, MICHAEL WOROSZ OF TAKE-TWO INTERACTIVE SOFTWARE, INC. (NASDAQGS:TTWO) WILL JOIN THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE COMPANY. THE COMPANY ISSUED $19,720,233 PURSUANT TO EXEMPTION PROVIDED UNDER REGULATION D FROM 5 INVESTORS.'}
